WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.741 --> 00:00:08.718
Venue managers send staffing requests from the mobile app. When you approve a

2
00:00:08.718 --> 00:00:14.927
request, Crewflow sends an offer to each person you selected. This tutorial uses

3
00:00:14.927 --> 00:00:17.178
fictional demonstration data.

4
00:00:17.632 --> 00:00:24.091
Open Venue Offers in the sidebar. Requests waiting for you show Pending approval.

5
00:00:24.546 --> 00:00:32.096
Open the pending request. The drawer shows the venue, role, times, and the staff the

6
00:00:32.096 --> 00:00:33.894
venue manager chose.

7
00:00:34.353 --> 00:00:39.962
Here, two places are still open, so select staff to fill them.

8
00:00:41.498 --> 00:00:47.527
On the Select Staff page, tick the people you want, then select Confirm.

9
00:00:47.981 --> 00:00:51.590
With every place filled, select Approve.

10
00:00:52.048 --> 00:00:58.307
The staffing board opens, with the new offers in the Offered lane. Each staff member

11
00:00:58.307 --> 00:01:00.841
still needs to accept their offer.
